{"id":"n24050-1-9","stage":3,"title":"음성 · 人声","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n24050-1-9-1","ko":"나는 이만 집에 가야겠어.","zh":"我该回家了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나는","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이만","meaning":"到此为止","explanation":"이만：到此为止","readings":[{"term":"이만","audio":"/audio/02edd343f9eb4851da7e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71908","senseId":"1","lemma":"이만","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"집에","meaning":"家","explanation":"집：家；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"3","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가야겠어.","meaning":"去，上","explanation":"가다：去，上；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"6","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"02edd343f9eb4851","term":"이만","zh":"到此为止","audio":"/audio/02edd343f9eb4851da7e.mp3","entryId":"71908","definition":"到这个程度就结束或停止。","pronunciation":["이만"]},{"id":"99cf116bb12cf106","term":"집","zh":"家","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3","entryId":"71358","definition":"组成家庭而生活的一家子。","pronunciation":["집"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去，上","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为某种目的而向某个地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/33683bc2ec9d06549cac.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n24050-1-9-2","ko":"그래, 전화로 무서운 음성이 들리는 걸 보니 아내가 화난 모양이네.","zh":"好，听电话里那吓人的语气，你妻子好像生气了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그래,","meaning":"好吧，是","explanation":"그래：好吧，是","readings":[{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27656","senseId":"1","lemma":"그래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"전화로","meaning":"电话","explanation":"전화：电话；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"전화","audio":"/audio/6db518d738ede9912d10.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20260","senseId":"2","lemma":"전화","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"무서운","meaning":"可怕，恐怖，畏惧","explanation":"무섭다：可怕，恐怖，畏惧；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"무섭다","audio":"/audio/6c5692ebced898c0376c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55637","senseId":"2","lemma":"무섭다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"음성이","meaning":"人声，语音，声响","explanation":"음성：人声，语音，声响；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"음성","audio":"/audio/a7661883a18bd9806da7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24050","senseId":"1","lemma":"음성","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"들리는","meaning":"听到，传来","explanation":"들리다：听到，传来；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"들리다","audio":"/audio/f5d8f68f409d3cd71df1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70783","senseId":"1","lemma":"들리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"걸","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。；ㄹ：을/를 的缩略，标记宾语，如 뭘＝무엇을。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보니","meaning":"推测","explanation":"보다：推测；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"20","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아내가","meaning":"妻子，爱人，老婆","explanation":"아내：妻子，爱人，老婆；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"아내","audio":"/audio/3611acca94af861ef852.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30196","senseId":"1","lemma":"아내","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"화난","meaning":"生气，发火","explanation":"화나다：生气，发火；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"화나다","audio":"/audio/380dff375fc26c29cffe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"87582","senseId":"1","lemma":"화나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"모양이네.","meaning":"情况，样子","explanation":"모양：情况，样子；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"모양","audio":"/audio/f1cd655a5837981f96d3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62397","senseId":"3","lemma":"모양","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d39087dda3899d88","term":"그래","zh":"好吧，是","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3","entryId":"27656","definition":"用于回答，表示“会那样做，是那样的，知道了”等肯定的含义。","pronunciation":["그래"]},{"id":"6db518d738ede991","term":"전화","zh":"电话","audio":"/audio/6db518d738ede9912d10.mp3","entryId":"20260","definition":"人们通过电话机交谈；或指通过那样传达的内容。","pronunciation":["전ː화"]},{"id":"6c5692ebced898c0","term":"무섭다","zh":"可怕，恐怖，畏惧","audio":"/audio/6c5692ebced898c0376c.mp3","entryId":"55637","definition":"难以面对或想逃避某个人或某种状况。","pronunciation":["무섭따"]},{"id":"a7661883a18bd980","term":"음성","zh":"人声，语音，声响","audio":"/audio/a7661883a18bd9806da7.mp3","entryId":"24050","definition":"人的声音或说话的声音。","pronunciation":["음성"]},{"id":"f5d8f68f409d3cd7","term":"들리다","zh":"听到，传来","audio":"/audio/f5d8f68f409d3cd71df1.mp3","entryId":"70783","definition":"通过耳朵接受声音。","pronunciation":["들리다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"推测","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"根据某事判断。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"3611acca94af861e","term":"아내","zh":"妻子，爱人，老婆","audio":"/audio/3611acca94af861ef852.mp3","entryId":"30196","definition":"结婚而成为男子的配偶的女人。","pronunciation":["아내"]},{"id":"380dff375fc26c29","term":"화나다","zh":"生气，发火","audio":"/audio/380dff375fc26c29cffe.mp3","entryId":"87582","definition":"非常懊恼或不合心意而心情变差。","pronunciation":["화ː나다"]},{"id":"f1cd655a5837981f","term":"모양","zh":"情况，样子","audio":"/audio/f1cd655a5837981f96d3.mp3","entryId":"62397","definition":"某种状况或状态；或指事情的进展状况。","pronunciation":["모양"]}],"audio":"/audio/9780751eef80b023babf.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.217,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=24050","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":117,"sequenceScore":3.0437,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["好，听电话里那吓人的语气，你妻子好像生气了。","我该回家了。","敏俊做了错事之后不仅不道歉，还一副理所当然的样子。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我该回家了。","敏俊做了错事之后不仅不道歉，还一副理所当然的样子。","好，听电话里那吓人的语气，你妻子好像生气了。"],"answer":2}]}
